message: Please cite this software and the accompanying method manuscript.
type: software
title: 'coherentSurv: Coherent Survival Modelling and Dynamic Forecasting for Recurrent and Terminal Events in R and Python'
version: 0.11.1
license: GPL-3.0-only
authors:
  - family-names: Adetunji
    given-names: Sunday A.
    affiliation: Oregon State University
  - family-names: Adetunji
