abstract: >-
  R package for coherent survival modelling and dynamic forecasting of
  recurrent and terminal events, with Python access through rpy2 and Rscript.
  Observation-aware inference, sensitivity analyses and baseline treatment
  contrasts retain their explicit assumptions.
